		{"id":"a0b1c2d3e4f50001","type":"text","text":"# 网站技术栈全景图\n基于 learning_notes 知识体系整理","x":280,"y":-140,"width":520,"height":90,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n0000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## HTML & CSS\n- HTML5 语义化标签\n- DOM 操作\n- Canvas 画布\n- SVG 矢量图形\n- Web Component\n---\n- Flex / Grid 布局\n- 层叠上下文\n- CSS 变量\n- 伪类 & 选择器\n- 响应式 / 媒体查询\n- 像素 & 移动适配","x":10,"y":50,"width":240,"height":340},
		{"id":"n0000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## JS & TS\n- ES6+ 新特性\n- 原型链 & 继承\n- Event Loop 事件循环\n- Promise / Async\n- 模块化 (ESM / CJS)\n- 柯里化 / 函数式\n- V8 引擎原理\n---\n- TypeScript 类型系统\n- 条件类型 / 泛型\n- 协变 & 逆变\n- 类型体操实战","x":280,"y":50,"width":240,"height":340},
		{"id":"n0000000000000003","type":"text","text":"### Less\n预处理器\n变量 / 混入 / 嵌套\n\n### TailwindCSS\n原子化 CSS\n工具链生态\n\n### CSS Modules\n组件级样式隔离\n\n### CSS Tricks\n实用技巧合集\n渐变 / 打字机 / 滚动条","x":630,"y":50,"width":220,"height":340},
		{"id":"n0000000000000004","type":"text","text":"### React\nHooks / Fiber / JSX\n函数组件生态\n\n### Vue\nVue2 → Vue3 迁移\nVite 构建 / 响应式系统\n\n### Svelte\n编译时框架\n\n### PixiJS\n2D 渲染引擎\n\n### RxJS\n响应式编程 / Observable","x":970,"y":50,"width":280,"height":340},
		{"id":"n0000000000000005","type":"text","text":"### Redux\n经典 Flux 架构\n\n### Zustand\n轻量级状态管理\n\n### Immer\n不可变数据操作\n\n### Nanostores\n原子化跨框架状态","x":10,"y":550,"width":240,"height":280},
		{"id":"n0000000000000006","type":"text","text":"### 存储 & 缓存\n- Cache-Control\n- Cookie\n- WebStorage\n\n### 通信协议\n- WebSocket\n- XHR / Fetch\n- Stream API","x":370,"y":550,"width":200,"height":280},
		{"id":"n0000000000000007","type":"text","text":"### 浏览器 API\n- Worker 多线程\n- MutationObserver\n- Task Scheduling\n\n### 网络 & 移动端\n- HTTP 协议\n- 移动端适配\n- DeepLink","x":590,"y":550,"width":180,"height":280},
		{"id":"n0000000000000009","type":"text","text":"### 构建工具\n- **Webpack** 模块打包\n  Plugin / 优化 / Hash\n  Module Federation\n- **Vite** 下一代构建工具\n- **Rollup** 库打包利器\n- **Babel** JS 编译转换\n- **Gulp** 任务流自动化","x":10,"y":990,"width":310,"height":280},
		{"id":"n0000000000000010","type":"text","text":"### 包管理器\n- **pnpm** 高效依赖管理\n- package.json 配置详解\n\n### 工程规范\n- Monorepo 多包架构\n- ESLint 代码规范\n\n### 组件开发\n- Storybook\n  组件驱动开发 & 文档","x":340,"y":990,"width":290,"height":280},
		{"id":"n0000000000000013","type":"text","text":"### SSR 基础\n服务端渲染原理\n同构应用架构\n\n### React Server Component\nRSC 服务端组件\n零客户端 JS 开销\n服务端数据获取","x":10,"y":1430,"width":310,"height":240},
		{"id":"n0000000000000014","type":"text","text":"### Streaming HTML\n流式 HTML 传输\n渐进式页面渲染\n\n### React Stream 架构\nSuspense + Streaming\n并发渲染模型\n选择性水合 (Hydration)","x":340,"y":1430,"width":290,"height":240},
		{"id":"n0000000000000008","type":"text","text":"### XSS 跨站脚本\n注入恶意脚本\n输入过滤 / 输出编码\n\n### CSRF 跨站请求伪造\nToken 验证\nSameSite Cookie\n\n### CSP 内容安全策略\n资源白名单\n限制脚本加载来源","x":890,"y":550,"width":360,"height":280},
		{"id":"n0000000000000011","type":"text","text":"### 性能优化\n- 前端性能方案\n- Webpack 产物优化\n- 图片压缩策略\n- will-change 提示\n- 任务优先级调度\n- 缓存策略 (Hash)","x":750,"y":990,"width":240,"height":280},
		{"id":"n0000000000000012","type":"text","text":"### 测试\n- Unit Test 单元测试\n- AST 抽象语法树分析\n\n### 代码质量\n- ESLint 静态检查\n- TypeScript 严格模式\n- TS 编译性能调优","x":1010,"y":990,"width":240,"height":280},
		{"id":"n0000000000000015","type":"text","text":"### Node.js\n- 事件驱动架构\n- 常用库生态\n- nvm 版本管理\n\n### Golang\n- 高并发服务\n- 系统编程","x":750,"y":1430,"width":240,"height":240},
